  "video_link": "",
  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Elevate your style with Rothco&rsquo;s G.I. Style Beret, available in various colors. Crafted from lightweight 95% wool and 5% nylon, it maintains its shape. The drawstring vinyl trim prevents fraying and allows for a customizable fit. Equipped with a built-in clutch for structure, it's ready for a flash attachment (badge not included). Enjoy comfort with the cotton liner and stay cool with dual side eyelets.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "13257",
  "description": "<p>Elevate your style with Rothco&rsquo;s G.I. Style Beret, available in various colors. Crafted from lightweight 95% wool and 5% nylon, it maintains its shape. The drawstring vinyl trim prevents fraying and allows for a customizable fit. Equipped with a built-in clutch for structure, it's ready for a flash attachment (badge not included). Enjoy comfort with the cotton liner and stay cool with dual side eyelets. Perfect for various occasions, whether it&rsquo;s for a uniform, costume, or daily wear, this wool beret adds a touch of sophistication to any outfit. Keep your head in the game with Rothco&rsquo;s collection of headwear and accessories. Designed with precision and purpose, our headgear is built to withstand the harshest conditions. Whether you&rsquo;re tackling the cold in one of our Watch Caps or Balaclavas, or out on a mission in a Boonie Hat or Fatigue Cap, our diverse range of headwear provides unmatched comfort and protection for everyone from active-duty personnel to outdoor enthusiasts.</p>",
